// `beat` and `bar` are injected by the Kanopi Hydra adapter on every tick
// of the shared transport (cf docs/design/ADAPTER_SPEC §5bis). They are bare
// identifiers thanks to `with (synth)` scope in the adapter - no globals.
//
// Amplitude pulses on each beat (Math.sin of beat * PI flips per quarter note),
// rotation drifts with bar count so the pattern slowly turns.
osc(60, 0.1, () => 0.5 + 0.5 * Math.sin(beat * Math.PI))
  .rotate(() => bar * 0.05)
  .out()
